{{!
    @template tool_vae/pending_page

    The page of the declarations awaiting an attestation, below its heading: what the list is, the form of the reader's
    choice, then one sentence when nothing is left, or the table, the oldest first.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\pending_page. The template holds no logic. Every
    text, number and address is escaped (double braces), except one key of HTML (triple braces): tablehtml, the table drawn
    by the template tool_vae/table. A line break between two fields of the form is drawn as one space, as before.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * intro - string, what the list is
    * form - {action, dayslabel, days, max, unreached, unreachedlabel, show}: the form; unreached is a bool, the box ticked
    * none - false, or a string: the sentence drawn when no vaeiste is left
    * tablehtml - false, or HTML: the table

    Example context (json):
    {
        "intro": "The declarations that no manager has attested yet, by candidate, the oldest first.",
        "form": {
            "action": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/pending.php",
            "dayslabel": "Waiting for at least this many days",
            "days": 30,
            "max": 365,
            "unreached": true,
            "unreachedlabel": "Only the candidates nobody can be told of",
            "show": "Show"
        },
        "none": false,
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable tool-vae-pending\"><tbody><tr><td>Camille Durand</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    }
}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{#form}}
<form method="get" action="{{action}}">
    <label for="pendingdays">{{dayslabel}}</label>
    <input type="number" name="days" id="pendingdays" min="0" max="{{max}}" value="{{days}}">
    <input type="checkbox" name="unreached" id="pendingunreached" value="1"{{#unreached}} checked="checked"{{/unreached}}>
    <label for="pendingunreached">{{unreachedlabel}}</label>
    <input type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary" value="{{show}}">
</form>
{{/form}}
{{#none}}
<p>{{none}}</p>
{{/none}}
{{#tablehtml}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{/tablehtml}}
